// Module c-sleep: sleep neurology. Excessive daytime sleepiness and narcolepsy (with
// obstructive sleep apnea, insufficient sleep, and drugs as the causes to exclude first),
// then movement and behavior in sleep: REM sleep behavior disorder, NREM parasomnias,
// nocturnal frontal lobe seizures as a mimic, and restless legs syndrome.
// Doses and numerical test cutoffs are deliberately left out.

